Health Monitoring System using DSA in C
Introduction
This project is a Health Monitoring System developed using C language and Binary Search Tree (BST). It stores patient information and calculates BMI automatically.
Objectives
1. Store patient records efficiently.
2. Calculate BMI.
3. Display patient health condition.
4. Use Data Structures in real applications.
Data Structure Used
Binary Search Tree (BST) is used to store patient records based on Patient ID.
BMI Formula
BMI = Weight / (Height × Height)
Modules
1. Add Patient
2. BMI Calculation
3. Display Records
4. Exit
Advantages
Easy data management, faster insertion, organized records, and simple implementation.
Conclusion
The Health Monitoring System is a simple and useful project that demonstrates the use of Data Structures in healthcare applications.
